{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>AiGoodbye 是一款在 iPhone 與 iPad 上離線運作的人工智能助理，適合重視私隱、經常開會錄音、需要即時翻譯或掃描文件的人士。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>；對話、錄音與影像內容均留在裝置上，毋須帳戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-189.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線人工智能助理功能</h2>\n<p>AiGoodbye 在裝置上提供免手持語音對話、會議錄音轉錄與重點摘要，並支援 13 種語言雙向離線翻譯。它可理解相片、手寫筆記及掃描文件，亦可就 PDF 與文字檔回答提問。另設私人記憶、Face ID 鎖定與多款可下載人工智能模型，所有內容不會離開裝置。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-152-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-153-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-154-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-155-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-156-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：AiGoodbye</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/aigoodbye/id6757513032?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T01:53:08.488197+00:00","quality":{"score":1,